00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
PETRAEUS: Kim Jong-Un is the sun around which everything revolves in North Korea.

3
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
He has proven to be a very ruthless, impulsive and cruel leader.

